{"kp_id": "zj-043.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-043", "type": "study_method", "statement": "穴为工具，当役使穴道，勿被书上穴名奴役；先立观念再选穴。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.ki"], "chapter_id": "zj-043.c01", "evidence_quote": "穴道是给你的工具，你要奴役这个穴道", "seg_from": 9, "seg_to": 10, "start_s": 58.67, "end_s": 69.575, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6hYSqrST1NI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hYSqrST1NI&t=58s", "series": "zj", "episode": 43, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 43", "start_s": 58.67, "end_s": 69.58}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-043.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-043", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "阴谷为肾经合穴属水，与肾水同属，为本穴；两筋间对骨取之。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ki10", "meridian.ki"], "chapter_id": "zj-043.c01", "evidence_quote": "阴骨就是肾经的什么本穴", "seg_from": 15, "seg_to": 19, "start_s": 84.55, "end_s": 130.23, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6hYSqrST1NI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hYSqrST1NI&t=84s", "series": "zj", "episode": 43, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 43", "start_s": 84.55, "end_s": 130.23}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "阴骨=阴谷；河穴=合穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-043.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-043", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "本穴得气即可出水气之性，平补平泻即可，不必强求补泻手法。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.ki10", "method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-043.c01", "evidence_quote": "无所谓，补泻平不平泻，你只要扎到针，引到气", "seg_from": 49, "seg_to": 49, "start_s": 296.15, "end_s": 306.795, "citation": {"youtube_id": "6hYSqrST1NI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hYSqrST1NI&t=296s", "series": "zj", "episode": 43, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 43", "start_s": 296.15, "end_s": 306.8}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
